      "message": "I was hoping we could do something more like the ArchTierLimits feature tests, where we\u0027d have a set of subgroup matrix configs that we\u0027d expect to see for each device that supports subgroup matrix.\n\nThere won\u0027t be many devices on the farm that support it (unfortunately), so it\u0027d hopefully be a relative short list.\n\nBut something like:\n```\ndevice_map[\"Apple_M2\"] \u003d {\n  {f32, f32, 8, 8, 8},\n  {f16, f16, 8, 8, 8},\n};\ndevice_map[\"NVIDIA_blah\"] \u003d {\n  {f16, f32, 16, 8, 8},\n  {u8, u32, 16, 16, 8},\n  // etc\n};\n```",
